# The storefront is fully static. Products and homepage settings live in
# src/content/*.json and are edited through the GitHub-backed admin at /admin.
#
# No API URL is required. Everything below is set in Vercel, never in this file.
# GitHub OAuth for the admin: GITHUB_OAUTH_CLIENT_ID, GITHUB_OAUTH_CLIENT_SECRET.
#
# Photo uploads (optional). Add all three in Vercel → Project → Settings →
# Environment Variables (ImageKit dashboard → Developer options → API keys),
# then redeploy. /api/imagekit signs each upload server-side; the private key
# never reaches the browser. Leave them out and photos keep being committed to
# frontend/public/uploads exactly as before.
# IMAGEKIT_PRIVATE_KEY=
# IMAGEKIT_PUBLIC_KEY=
# IMAGEKIT_URL_ENDPOINT=https://ik.imagekit.io/w4bq6axnq
